### Notes

Students are urged to work closely with Professor Sandy Davis while working on this Career Studies Certificate. Students are urged to acquaint themselves with the requirements of the major department in the college or university to which transfer is contemplated; and further, to consult with their counselors and advisors at VHCC in planning their academic program and electives.
